          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"An earthy introduction to the ritual, instruments, and people behind {{BUSINESS_NAME}}.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--earth-1:#544132;--earth-2:#8b6b4a;--accent:#c9a77e;--ivory:#fbf8f3;--muted:#7a6a5f}\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;line-height:1.45;color:var(--earth-1);background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--ivory) 0%, #fffaf6 60%);min-height:100vh}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 28px;background:transparent}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--earth-2),var(--accent));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}\\n    nav a{color:var(--earth-1);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-weight:600}\\n    nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline}\\n\\n    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:36px auto;padding:28px}\\n    .hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:18px;padding:36px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(84,65,50,0.06),rgba(201,167,126,0.04));box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(84,65,50,0.06)}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px;color:var(--earth-1)}\\n    .hero p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* gentle svg background */\\n    .pattern-svg{position:absolute;right:-8%;top:-18%;width:56%;opacity:0.14;transform:rotate(14deg)}\\n\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;margin-top:26px}\\n    .card{background:white;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;border:1px solid rgba(84,65,50,0.04)}\\n    h2{margin-top:0;color:var(--earth-2)}\\n    ul{margin:0 0 0 18px}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;padding:8px 12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--earth-2),var(--accent));color:white;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700}\\n\\n    .what{font-size:15px;color:#4d433d}\\n    .flow{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .phase{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(198,164,131,0.04),transparent);border-left:4px solid var(--accent);padding:12px;border-radius:8px}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:32px;padding:22px 28px;background:transparent;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}nav{display:none}.logo{width:46px;height:46px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">SB</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Gatherings</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"private-sessions.html\\\">Private</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Membership</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <section class=\\\"hero card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"about-hero\\\">\\n      <svg class=\\\"pattern-svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 600 400\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n        <defs>\\n          <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n            <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#c9a77e\\\"/>\\n            <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#8b6b4a\\\"/>\\n          </linearGradient>\\n        </defs>\\n        <g transform=\\\"translate(0,40)\\\">\\n          <ellipse cx=\\\"420\\\" cy=\\\"140\\\" rx=\\\"260\\\" ry=\\\"100\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\"/>\\n          <ellipse cx=\\\"460\\\" cy=\\\"80\\\" rx=\\\"180\\\" ry=\\\"60\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.18\\\"/>\\n        </g>\\n      </svg>\\n      <h1 id=\\\"about-hero\\\">A place where sound settles the senses</h1>\\n      <p>We craft held experiences—slow, sensory journeys led by {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} that invite rest, release, and quiet curiosity.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n      <section class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"ritual-title\\\">\\n        <h2 id=\\\"ritual-title\\\">The Ritual — how a ceremony unfolds</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"what\\\">Our gatherings are composed like a short pilgrimage: arrival, attuning, resonance, and soft return. Each part is intentional and paced for deep listening.</p>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"flow\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"phase\\\"><strong>Arrival & settling (10–15 min)</strong><div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">Guests arrive, remove shoes, choose blankets and bolsters. We share a brief orientation and intention setting.</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"phase\\\"><strong>Grounding & breath (8–12 min)</strong><div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">A guided breath and body scan to invite presence.</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"phase\\\"><strong>Sound journey (30–45 min)</strong><div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">We layer instruments — a warm monochord, crystal singing bowls, and reverent chimes — to shape an evolving landscape of tone.</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"phase\\\"><strong>Rest & return (10–15 min)</strong><div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">Soft silence, a gentle bell, and an invitation back to sitting. Light tea afterwards for lingering connection.</div></div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:14px;color:var(--earth-2)\\\">Instruments you might hear</h3>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li>Monochord — long, humming harmonic bed</li>\\n          <li>Crystal bowls — crystalline sustain and shimmer</li>\\n          <li>Tuning forks — precise, focused frequencies</li>\\n        </ul>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\"><em>Note</em>: Instrument selection varies by session to keep each gathering unique.</p>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"prep-title\\\">\\n        <h2 id=\\\"prep-title\\\">What to bring</h2>\\n        <ul>\\n          <li>Soft blanket or yoga mat</li>\\n          <li>Pillow or bolster for knees/support</li>\\n          <li>An eye mask if you prefer darkness</li>\\n          <li>Water bottle</li>\\n        </ul>\\n\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:12px;color:var(--earth-2)\\\">Contraindications & care</h3>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">If you have epilepsy, are pregnant, have a pacemaker, or are currently experiencing acute psychiatric distress, please contact us before attending. Sound vibrational experiences may not be suitable for everyone. For concerns email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> or call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a>.</p>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Become a member</div>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px;font-size:14px\\\">Members enjoy priority booking, a discounted series, and a weekly sound drop. Learn more on the <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">membership page</a>.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n      <h2>Our facilitator</h2>\\n      <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">{{FACILITATOR_NAME}} holds a careful practice of listening and facilitation. Trained in somatic presence and sound craft, they guide with gentle instruction and deep attention to safety and embodiment.</p>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a href=\\\"events.html\\\">See upcoming gatherings</a> or <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">reserve a space</a> for yourself or a small group.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div style=\\\"font-size:13px\\\">Serving the community in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a> • <a href=\\\"privacy.html\\\">Privacy</a></div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"faq.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>FAQs — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Frequently asked questions about attending a sound bath with {{BUSINESS_NAME}}.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fffaf6;--dark:#4b3a2f;--warm:#b88b60;--soft:#7f6b60}\\n    body{font-family:system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#fff);color:var(--dark);margin:0;padding:0}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(75,58,47,0.04)}\\n    .logo{font-weight:800;color:var(--warm)}\\n    nav a{margin-left:16px;color:var(--dark);text-decoration:none}\\n    main{max-width:920px;margin:30px auto;padding:20px}\\n    h1{margin-top:0;color:var(--warm)}\\n    .faq-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:20px}\\n    .qa{background:white;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(75,58,47,0.04)}\\n    .side{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(184,139,96,0.06),transparent);padding:18px;border-radius:12px}\\n    details{margin-bottom:12px}\\n    summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}\\n    summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}\\n    .muted{color:var(--soft)}\\n    footer{margin-top:20px;color:var(--soft);font-size:13px}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.faq-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}nav{display:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"logo\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Return</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Upcoming</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <h1>Questions you may have — answered simply</h1>\\n    <p class=\\\"muted\\\">A small compendium of practical notes for first-timers and regulars alike.</p>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"faq-list\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div class=\\\"qa\\\">\\n          <details open>\\n            <summary>What should I bring and wear?</summary>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Wear comfortable layers. Bring a blanket, pillow/bolster, and an eye mask if you prefer darkness. Socks or warm feet are recommended; shoes are removed in the studio.</div>\\n          </details>\\n\\n          <details>\\n            <summary>Is a sound bath a religious ceremony?</summary>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">No. Our sessions are non-denominational. They are designed as therapeutic and restorative gatherings centered around breath, body, and listening.</div>\\n          </details>\\n\\n          <details>\\n            <summary>Are sound baths safe? Any contraindications?</summary>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Most people find sound baths restful, but they are not suitable for everyone. Contraindications include epilepsy, recent concussion, pregnancy (especially in late stages), implanted medical devices such as pacemakers, or acute psychiatric conditions. If you have concerns, please reach out before attending at <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</div>\\n          </details>\\n\\n          <details>\\n            <summary>Will I fall asleep?</summary>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Many participants drift into deep relaxation or sleep — that is entirely fine. The session structure accounts for rest; you'll be gently guided back at the close.</div>\\n          </details>\\n\\n          <details>\\n            <summary>What is the flow of a session?</summary>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Typically: arrival and seating (10–15 min), a short grounding practice (breath or body scan), the sound journey (30–45 min) where instruments like gongs, chimes, or crystal bowls are layered, followed by a gradual return and light closing (10–15 min). Each session may vary slightly.</div>\\n          </details>\\n\\n          <details>\\n            <summary>Is there social time afterwards?</summary>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Yes — we usually offer tea and a chance to linger for a few minutes. It's optional and a gentle way to reintegrate.</div>\\n          </details>\\n\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"side\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0;color:var(--warm)\\\">Quick logistics</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Arrival: please come 10–12 minutes early to settle. Sessions begin promptly to preserve the experience for everyone.</p>\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">Cancellations</h4>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Cancellations within 48 hours may not be refundable. Members have more flexible cancellation options — see <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Membership</a>.</p>\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">Accessibility</h4>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">We aim to be accessible. Please contact us in advance to discuss accommodations: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</p>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--warm);color:white;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700\\\">Reserve a place</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>Questions not answered here? Email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> or call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a>. Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"book.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Book — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Reserve your spot for the next sound bath or schedule a private session with {{BUSINESS_NAME}}.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fffdfa;--deep:#402f25;--terra:#b07950;--light:#f7efe7}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;background:var(--bg);color:var(--deep)}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 22px}\\n    .nav a{margin-left:12px;color:var(--deep);text-decoration:none}\\n    main{max-width:980px;margin:26px auto;padding:20px}\\n    .panel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:24px}\\n    .book-card{background:white;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(64,47,37,0.04)}\\n    label{display:block;margin-top:12px;font-weight:700}\\n    input[type=text],input[type=email],select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;margin-top:6px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(64,47,37,0.08)}\\n    .muted{color:#6f5f55;font-size:14px}\\n    .actions{margin-top:14px}\\n    button{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--terra),#a66b44);color:white;border:none;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700}\\n    .side{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(176,121,80,0.05),transparent);padding:18px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .option{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.02);margin-top:10px}\\n    footer{margin-top:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.panel{grid-template-columns:1fr}nav{display:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">Reserve • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    <nav class=\\\"nav\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Events</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"faq.html\\\">FAQs</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <h1 style=\\\"margin-top:0;color:var(--terra)\\\">Book a session</h1>\\n    <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Choose an offering below: community gathering, private 1:1, or a small-group membership plan.</p>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n      <form class=\\\"book-card\\\" action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n        <label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\">\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\">\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\">\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"offering\\\">Select an offering</label>\\n        <select id=\\\"offering\\\" name=\\\"offering\\\">\\n          <option value=\\\"community\\\">Community Sound Bath — single session</option>\\n          <option value=\\\"membership\\\">Membership — monthly drop & priority booking</option>\\n          <option value=\\\"private-1to1\\\">Private 1:1 — personalized session</option>\\n          <option value=\\\"private-couples\\\">Couples — shared tuning</option>\\n        </select>\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"date\\\">Preferred date</label>\\n        <input id=\\\"date\\\" name=\\\"date\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"e.g. {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}} or flexible\\\">\\n\\n        <label for=\\\"notes\\\">Any notes or questions</label>\\n        <textarea id=\\\"notes\\\" name=\\\"notes\\\" rows=\\\"4\\\" placeholder=\\\"Health notes, accessibility needs, membership ID\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n        <label style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" name=\\\"recurring\\\"> Join as a recurring member (monthly)</label>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"actions\\\">\\n          <button type=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">By booking you acknowledge the session is a restorative experience and that loud sudden noises or strong vibrations can be part of the practice. Please disclose medical conditions in the notes or contact <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</p>\\n      </form>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"side\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">Offerings at a glance</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"option\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>Community</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Open circle, drop-in friendly</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">$25</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"option\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>Membership</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Monthly series & priority booking</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">$55 / mo</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"option\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>Private 1:1</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Tailored session—home visits available</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">$120</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">Need help?</h4>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Questions, accessibility needs, or booking for a group? Call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</p>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <a href=\\\"private-sessions.html\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;padding:8px 12px;background:var(--terra);color:white;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none\\\">Private options</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div class=\\\"muted\\\">If you're booking on behalf of a workplace or event at {{VENUE_NAME}}, please use the private sessions page. We look forward to holding space with you in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
        }
      ],
